{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10006_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:645450afab3af7403bd72eb47fafd0dbb5f825e4a3c38a56e92b2c76ee568d48",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ce8b5579fb51c36ff3073ac8bcd58dd6ac535604d60568c35a1c7b1d7ee19e7",
      "text": "越过我们的那端",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d69f9326d65f8c7e2734bf2f3f105a90bba25e28211c74d5612907dcc33fd97d",
      "text": "もふもふえん决定作为惊喜嘉宾在结业典礼上\n举行现场表演。正当他们为了正式演出\n而刻苦练习的某一天，三人聊起了\n“要是长成了大人会怎样？”的话题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000007:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000007:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ce8b5579fb51c36ff3073ac8bcd58dd6ac535604d60568c35a1c7b1d7ee19e7",
      "text": "越过我们的那端",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6402e9e83c454d76b42c8b0bb83ef2a21e8ea3c9bda1b79f4d4dbd13f8c0a78",
      "text": "哼哼哼～，哼哼哼——哼哼♪\n……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bbacdc9473b8a904f46dfcdb542bdf525b64b0ad8a4f01f17816a23aab19ceb",
      "text": "幼儿园",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:822108d7d55372bd3223d830a7a1869f13d488bf027bee0836fcdff5e854a967",
      "text": "这个玩具是我的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06ff79c67a5ae340b467ef80b5837cee191768c631120a009fcf54d60d2682a2",
      "text": "才不是！\n明明是我先想玩的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c979ebdf4267ee16aaaf093fcdfa712bb198b6395fb74c7753d62bcd2a27760",
      "text": "大家，不可以吵架哦！\n连もふもふえん都说了大家要好好相处呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69ead8ef39bbf5acb39d7256757650efa9a4ffe7bf431b9c972d8e34701dc19b",
      "text": "……“大家，一起来唱歌吧！\n一起来跳舞吧♪”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:224d16dd30c55b522e353bf897c1d26327a9048bffedc8885861f3dd6b8c679b",
      "text": "啊，是《快乐闪耀》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8709adf40996c01c1984ba81164bf666129b1d3ecd808c22d598f0a7466fe23c",
      "text": "“快乐如此闪耀！\n属于我们的主题乐园！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe55556191ffc80c59301b1b40c3084844b48b70d32c597dd53cfbbdd031d72",
      "text": "……园长老师。果然，要是能把315 Production的\nもふもふえん请来结业典礼就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e83f299a346c5411ced88133c04fadd2868af03a8aec43845b34034a1890d311",
      "text": "是啊……如果他们能来的话，\n孩子们一定会很高兴的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c1d39d385b0610ead2e59b0d1b5e6500cd08f6a5a5f93610f2f4955fb02db14",
      "text": "嗯，一定很高兴的。……我抱着试一试的心态，\n给315 Production发一封委托邮件看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f25c3bf2a61b68827c07cb4ddb024c9e19d8fb3ec4522cfa656962631675a85",
      "text": "没想到真的能请到もふもふえん来参加结业典礼……！\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cd389a3dcae3736cfea0024eb7cff62e9706702649c7cc317fb6bf9f97d5ddc",
      "text": "我们才要感谢您委托这份工作！\n各位发来的邮件，我和もふもふえん一起看过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5bff2fa589b9b988ea06a38f1c05929e630fcca7cdec9f154e37d75a86de947",
      "text": "请、请问，“小朋友们票选的、\n最希望在结业典礼上见到的人排行榜！”我们也看到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1251db3b61522a8618ec5eefddaa83f74233698f0202e913545af400ac5085de",
      "text": "仅次于爸爸妈妈，\n花音他们もふもふえん排在后面呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2892aac4b6c5efe668f1cca7f93ca586f120f00ffc89d47879eb0f14ee7027c",
      "text": "超级开心的啊。\n结业典礼，我们绝对会让它成功的，请多关照啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9e2e4b19e88ee6cd48d39a8b2900e179013b66193a7f73cd327f9c373c3f38",
      "text": "不、不行啦志狼君。\n声音太大声的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06d9eab79753633557123f6abfe235c36141d1c77f3d82d69a395e7ef40202ce",
      "text": "不、不好意思。我们要出场的事情要保密来着对吧。\n那个……请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b3cf6288e864cb5e0a2cc548f2361c451e8b1bd18babec5bf83be99731d27b",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……花音他们的舞台，\n能吓他们一大跳就好了呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1aee2aabde45258610efbacd447ee1f375453ab1d07056e6040d838b7ea8e6a",
      "text": "是啊。到结业典礼当天为止，\n我们3个人要一起加油练习哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_b:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:290ca9554244e02527bc330614f7e26d35e637e3ef059718e80fa8775ab6100a",
      "text": "噢——",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac8b3d0b3eb1b955aa95678979e3bff380a7055332c8805f314d25605d85bc08",
      "text": "（好，邮件确认告一段落了。\nもふもふえん的大家在……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3e635b61c893a749d2f2bbf57b37f51b832f362a27f6b6812935177cdfa77e4",
      "text": "哇，直央君作业已经写完了吗？\n好厉害好厉害～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2689e4f36399d432fb5f0a26342a9de1ec8fe2d8c30844e14dbdeb95665e5f",
      "text": "谢、谢谢。你们两个，\n要是有不会的地方我可以帮忙哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0e019df6c5eaa48247a26fcb637b667e84c3be0496ba7e38c917bd855d466ea",
      "text": "可以吗？谢谢你！\n花音这里不会做。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c06e89b2a5dc07b2c7faacee17b50b879f146eb16f4074e7138de1847daf53a",
      "text": "……我就算了。就算不用直央教，\n这种程度对我来说也是小菜一碟！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000085:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcade97c8450babae4541908b189ad48886a6bcaa6185090cd12c85cc44151c3",
      "text": "写完了～！\n直央君，谢谢你帮我♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e29e42a72ea447ecb86b6a79bc4ae8421564a69f0121c9ad6572c9b5c9a8294",
      "text": "不客气。\n那个，志狼君呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed1e6eb6679236135ca2184cb3d63a58c0f9723b98ecba904310d0496c81eab",
      "text": "还没呢……不过就差一点点了。\n休息时间里我绝对能写完！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1329d09ac6df1ef4f8566ca2de9369b758ee29e5a51f1ff542b22a855365ae75",
      "text": "（志狼君，好像写得不是很快的样子）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16b6959643688334829ec76b4b802d4275aa5442005f732561f4eb46d6898f23",
      "text": "（本来还想着写完作业之后，让志狼君\n教我跳舞的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_c:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:650c834a1257999999530be933d1f339704f1a59955c8b986d5e116c62a6ade8",
      "text": "（……啊，有了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef4445361830f9f7d2f110701d9accae9f6f715f2cc4763d322216bcb3261652",
      "text": "那个，我有件事想拜托志狼君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed0c84c2dfd74957a1d9037d48e131ed3c7e8f098a4021527eaacf3f2a2fe337",
      "text": "就是要在结业典礼舞台上跳的舞蹈，\n无论如何我都有个地方跳不好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca7fead651e1be26936cd8eced3d6939e576b5d5012ce682e7ca208e2b475a4c",
      "text": "啊——副歌前面的那个地方啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:835f73d23b87a2802990a3243ee9bcdabdf3367b1673001e5c98adf4f98f880e",
      "text": "嗯。想让志狼君教我\n跳那里的舞蹈……可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44ca7b1dd58746dc1f4ca2bb74257b8eef4643cb86896aaffb83f515ad7deae5",
      "text": "作为替代……虽然不知道算不算，\n我来帮志狼君写作业怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad99775a394b1d9d2429a16ae39c3a32f3ecbc4977fcc6efd4f7994f8d43bdc",
      "text": "哼～？就是所谓的交换条件啊。\n嘛，既然你都说到这份上了那就没办法啦。我答应你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bae0cbaa9b2f25e81e2170aab1bb09eddd7bd8f6266dec901a30631fed32ec8",
      "text": "谢谢你，志狼君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57ff279baf8d49756bcb61a87f82114f538ce82604c23f9fcf5830b31b71505f",
      "text": "既然这样，花音也要交换条件♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cfc5b866424836897bf931f278e3f77045f379b88376fc09019c54e0efd62b6",
      "text": "帮我写作业的直央君，\n我就教你超级无敌可爱的摆姿势方法吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:610ae6caf91518650dd7739a6a9ba1f98716fc724ab9268a05d2bcebf710b547",
      "text": "也谢谢花音君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_d:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:060a45b5f47e9030c4654992e8d08d98281e2842e81540b41e976b78c65ac423",
      "text": "大家互相教对方擅长的事情吧。\n这样一来肯定能变成很棒的舞台的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c190ce0e7ad1f85cb5f7f0ded3e4de59568ec70a3c603952dec71d5988859e4c",
      "text": "那么大家，先休息一下！\n时间到了我就回来哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c932a5e001e91a0e20d0081db5527121db4cd53a39ea3348042f031a21d318",
      "text": "舞蹈课辛苦了！\n休息的时候要好好补充水分哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2910a18eec8fd2dd5cd180079f7daaa70fc264fbed0798ef916403245c1c3d55",
      "text": "好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9e8b39dd182e0bc3138877e049bad4c94cc3759d86b83c4d92de853fc1547c6",
      "text": "昨天，我去参加了结业典礼的筹备商谈。那个时候，\n老师们让我转交一封写给各位的信哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:144131438173e6368b586fee6a74c1fd08c34f8f94cd6deebd9aaed297dd287c",
      "text": "“孩子们非常憧憬作为‘帅气大哥哥’的\nもふもふえん”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5580934f0130b45949839c52b6cf74f8789cdff3ae276ae0587bbf88bb35f684",
      "text": "“很多人都说‘长大之后想成为もふもふえん！’，\n三个人在大家心目中超级受欢迎呢”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bc7508436ef920f5f1465752e02ee1ed5cbd78ceaa3d2918ac5f028a1cd699d",
      "text": "哇啊……\n虽、虽然有点害羞，但好高兴啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a460b404bbc8aeb289748a85fe608c561dcdd15579febff760ae568fad52d67",
      "text": "既然这样，结业典礼的舞台，\n必须得帅气到极致才行了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee94908d1e12cd36dc3c7e165d5c3f20e61da99d92b06e28e7676fbdc6ccfaca",
      "text": "花音会展现出\n很多很多可爱的地方给他们看的～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_e:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eae0357a8a4effb19e5f7a985364c9da7785f5341c72b29f76f11a838177a26",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，我先离开一下。\n课程重新开始前我会回来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb51231d3c26f3aef8eb4b187b5d9145166d6d7c5d9f4a2beb6a55cf4dfbbc2c",
      "text": "说是长大以后，想变得像花音他们一样呢。\n诶嘿嘿，超级开心的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75af4b96254a153672951340abce6efb33e2f4a23cc8cceb6a4e42f9777c2324",
      "text": "嗯。能被他们那样看待，\n真的好厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f764c767ff0ec78d6d7af2609d810667ea6571301859f6cb135cf70135414fa",
      "text": "说起来……你们两个，将来想成为什么样的人啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c574dff3254230b13094a65c9ac4281d5b3773bf8cee8559bbe09c8f566c9e83",
      "text": "我当然是要成为世界第一的舞者啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9f66d7af334fa5018bc3f4c83c4d46f2ffdb7162631b25c2c4d3c4dea9721d5",
      "text": "花音要成为世界上最可爱的偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee121d2e1306a9b6e2586272ba1d0fa241cc8f7613561ffb98195339bff1b35c",
      "text": "我……以前的梦想是成为普通的上班族呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:022c1bdbce21a5de4ca8f20b55d4782663d7a2ba0d4fd63b2c661d5f6ec82d39",
      "text": "啊——直央的话确实会这么想呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad44234f8dd8c4f482705649f2d202391b201d691f51cb84660a43601c81a3aa",
      "text": "不过，真想象不出长大以后的直央会是什么样子啊。\n花音也是一样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a2a8fa7bfe7cb65ff23041158208c96b8e4e6aeadf9ee899f2d1ecfb89d1d92",
      "text": "哼。才不要呢，根本不需要变成大人。\n花音只要一直做可爱的小孩子就好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dbd05d068cc3defe376245e8803274a94dad01567d1d71a42379b840146fada",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n哪有人不会变成大人的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6c2560403ed4915520de1cdd631de6af0076bcef0c2d0086a2c52a3a6622e1",
      "text": "就、有嘛。我在图画书里看过的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ed3a0a432d1f3a0a9c12ca736f0445959b3b608c476bf9030ab61e1ff411b8",
      "text": "图画书是图画书吧？\n大家总有一天都会变成大人的啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6664b9eb5d8fac56655e34ec164c43328aa92bf7ef545a551743e6b7bc407890",
      "text": "但、但是，花音……呜呜～～……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f6d12c2bf85a7d30ad0449a13a6d1e46a2ef850f36de6e1b54598f107f6516",
      "text": "不、不要吵架啦，你们两个。\n所以说，那个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14817dc02d37b779b8a8f1cfced290112e49867b9bfac5b1c2494e4e5d0628e2",
      "text": "让各位久等了……等等，\n大家这是怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e34ab5c5f414620dce2e46cc13fb58da83b50a3ef30bce6f8371c89ace3a0c3",
      "text": "……原来如此，发生了这样的事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed9067272f7bf4b62d9e8658321092f9af1208620ba2d8a7c92e27f0766f3e42",
      "text": "你们两个人说的，其实都没错哦。\n那是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641555a166a8359526ad3f82dc00f4d28ebc88a76a363a077cedcf111babf9fa",
      "text": "才没有没错呢。\n志狼君说花音是不对的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cfe45891bd1b551980b8ea41a447e468f85685cc46de7747022b88c69f36797",
      "text": "大家，都有好好休息了吗？\n下半场要开始了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:558091a1127c10f75b3f145ff997f5ec34d718c21e3b5ca99fc928eafea5aa9c",
      "text": "（啊……到上课的时间了。\n怎、怎么办……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d61d61cccd64c73b12d5848b00fca3d392a49cfcacb7ce74242181d21a1efb",
      "text": "……虽然还在跟志狼君吵架，\n但工作很重要……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d230d3bb9186a38a67b5d19f71c199400da514ba103244bb47a0e955f3bec6e",
      "text": "而且还有很多大家在等着花音他们呢。\n只有在训练的时候先和好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef4ce7078e41bdbf0d7b8005266e90d4aa263a48211fc71acfa409e60d31140c",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a989dd767703900a51c1c1b5e896b45a9ddccfbb98f471d2c685862faad7df6",
      "text": "课程结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a83fa1b1324f234d6378e5dbb3503ed4fddcbdf007653f499c064d1eb230482",
      "text": "花音君。\n听说爸爸很快就来接你了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a29d88caa08f032fd4a4e530d7946cceec332ee87dc2ae51888b54a36817175",
      "text": "嗯……\n呐，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8a7ee4874da4933a5502651b205d96f9a08b378e04dfd7d03c2cdd5624be5c",
      "text": "花音一直做小孩子，不行吗？\n花音也必须得变成大人不可吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29ee28b248e38930c3835a9de0b87b3af16714cd09bd0870c12dd217aebab689",
      "text": "因为做小孩子的话，会有很多可爱的东西呀。\n爸爸做的也都是可爱的小孩子衣服不是嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6f0e782a8c20e3144ef645a8dca81a3bd8e72ae1f6a26d672ed135d9ea06cd5",
      "text": "长大了的话，就不是可爱的花音了呀。\n花音不想变大……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012839acdad853b50aeeb46ee3ffeb39cff637fcceb4c562c8a6371718a100cd",
      "text": "……花音君，没事的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8546a80f6eb7fca1d324565736975c975220dc9625069bd21bbbba642aef22e5",
      "text": "为了以成为世界第一可爱偶像为目标的花音君，\n我和许许多多的人，无论何时都会伸出援手的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f73166fb8b96b219556840013e394ac1848e095721e57848c934f769e9a31f0",
      "text": "而且，もふもふえん的大家也在一起！\n不管花音君长得多么高大……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fa7ad932ed427ce9d8971f863fe42ddb683b68eecd31de861b1b200ec0416c6",
      "text": "只要三个人在一起，一定能比现在\n更加更加可爱、更加闪闪发光的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b37e9decfa70a1aa3403e2b93b63d35f1e433db61e81ba851cbe58f07d0036",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc09e808e0e07f640a4f63f758d4ab160ffc67f30073b346527d34450fa8bcc2",
      "text": "……说的也是呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3b2807453fef3c62230eae7d14fa9757f11f44e28b9411dcf1be2963069cdc3",
      "text": "因为还有制作人，\n还有志狼君和直央君在嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54e056e2e648f9d5c134f13817cf5f16483fece187c6665ce70611cb18d4a0c2",
      "text": "变成大人的花音，也一定能闪闪发光的对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000078:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000087:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2eaf184bb0ed424105578ad88e1075364aebfc73df69171edf527cedcdbef3a2",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000089:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1335ce908bed2b86969f3c9812d3cb54674c8016a4faff39995ea6d4b97f5d1c",
      "text": "我从刚才开始就一直给花音打电话，\n但一直被无视……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000091:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17c34cd8ae5cfbc7eb0260365a5e203f4fd409a30091266022b873d7e15ed363",
      "text": "我只是想跟他说练习的时候对不起，\n想道个歉而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000093:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2846d5d91cabfb0d9c574b1cedac146f1844554a27ec40709788a3aa9b48bcee",
      "text": "呜呜～～\n要是关系就这样变僵了该怎么办啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000095:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb31897abbc1b6e74e91d78d4a03df6e30bcd0dc771cdd353cb23ac6e699608",
      "text": "下次他一定\n会接电话的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000098:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec843f14813be2fe1ae09149a59f5b660807d9fbbc09f5a4c05dbebbe37e74f3",
      "text": "呜呜，会是这样吗……\n不管打多少次是不是都没用啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000100:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83d64162b032c22f46c3780ed018c86ee99a9c3ec9db8fd615a59137cf412b55",
      "text": "嗯～～但是……我知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000102:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11baa1e8bcbe854941b2ebc5b081f3580c0f0b0dc21fe9a11bff402bf78a2fbc",
      "text": "既然●●●●プロデューサー都这么说了，\n那我就再打一次试试！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000104:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73601fbce3319e3094336d7a0dbb76ac66ce67b5c9ae64d027b4955b5a909aa9",
      "text": "谢谢你听我商量啊。\n总觉得稍微有了点勇气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_h:cmd-000106:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92174cdfa469bbe7353e1a34b604cf55dc3e4f382d75da234e3406b73e2069f",
      "text": "那先这样啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4fd9f2d9597b7de7ed13e2411b692c51442aeb717af6739dc9b36935210a8ed",
      "text": "花音的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:677af85d515d0dbbf3ca4e5d25811d5a1e81768d737a058ba375c53768d5cfe7",
      "text": "……不，花音这边才要说对不起呢。\n明天见咯，志狼君。明天见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9acdd4fa7995a07511b56cf67ea2e20c5f5d5536602a5df3fac0eff49ab14b5",
      "text": "跟志狼君和好了～。\n虽然很紧张，但打了电话真好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73ec9983cb34d5259412e0363fb4f1ee0c0deff7b23403aa5d326b6d91dc988d",
      "text": "呼啊……放下心来之后就困了。\n趁饭还没做好，先眯一会儿……呼，呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b4627436e3c6da99d79f0ea5a63efcdf5d00a72ea4237a81917d09878cca94e",
      "text": "（咦，这里是……？\n？那边有闪闪发光的人在……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb779b7e835e33b4c84d8c26d575b395d723d9a44e6656e13f9a99d2d27fe34c",
      "text": "直央真是的，又在紧张了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8207547a55346db84fec4580c5eb3f0f86102d1720157bcb2eb9de2659ef572",
      "text": "嗯、嗯。\n上台前果然还是会紧张的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:492f08e4b311a01ca797d6e595e783995d703a4d5d5f2ba2bd24e26e28232e22",
      "text": "直央君，花音他们跟你在一起哦♪\n今天的演唱会大家也一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0893a562513efef375be72ce8b715dd46ea8565dbff480249e6f0615d8ca5347",
      "text": "（哇……是变成大人的花音他们！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f240940e1597f3276f734395be030f344ec1b4d4e9df1c32d1f6d83d03c4052",
      "text": "（即使变成了大人，花音他们三个人也在一起呢！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac4cdda140fed7a8949983d5bac48069af2ccb6106e4d8be7aad52feead93ac3",
      "text": "（而且，正如●●●●プロデューサー\n说的那样，大家都闪闪发光……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07ff4d0ac02725931aff0b7aac397485ffa6117ff65d689b6941709481f3fa20",
      "text": "唔、唔唔……刚才的，是做梦……？\n诶嘿嘿，真是一个超级棒的梦啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70ad956f630603610d1ed5e7013f26388097b3b0f84bc7366173bbc6c190b1b",
      "text": "（花音要是能变成那样的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000186:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000193:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70359b87dec438bfc16050fe15d263749caf7bd9d7d60a939964b56b1d4d34ab",
      "text": "大家快听我说快听我说！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000195:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e5b8a1e0e7690cd83b38fefecdebc55c97644c2d1b16534c0a8c527250dcd3e",
      "text": "花音做了个\n和大家一起变成大人的梦哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000197:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b5186fff33a4f20954d9ef901b4be000a8269b4bf68d81e6b9794009491d8ac",
      "text": "变成大人的花音他们\n超级闪闪发光的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000199:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b454247de35244d73b495efa1522922cd505759eaa0079bd0070b6c4699b368",
      "text": "而且就算变成了大人\n也一直都是3个人\n非常要好哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_17</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000201:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:876b906c02667988a5e49dfda8f3b508f7a2bdf80aef84f6e4069038988d3faa",
      "text": "梦见变成大人，\n你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000203:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe1530cd6c0de3547290cb3fe114f075a5b6f3e78b514c87a828e47fe184fbe5",
      "text": "这样啊，那就太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000207:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25eeb5b989f2cf358fb3de61165d9ef7ede1748e3b6d8083766889490e9cf5e",
      "text": "说什么呢花音",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000209:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d365cdb0732a345b8c3a837cf2cbf4710012d0b821228c8ec865d2d9caa28de",
      "text": "もふもふえん感情一直很好\n那是理所当然的吧。\n对吧，直央！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000211:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:857f50ade6de659831d8cc1b9888457fba911c4a984edb2e7b032ecb0504b461",
      "text": "嗯。我也想一直和大家\n好好相处下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000213:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f62c1a510b1da5ed48ffaf3d543c019cce3d095b18cf26c5002da8d1d6405b5",
      "text": "你看吧。可不只是\n在花音做的梦里才这样哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_i:cmd-000215:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd2c8bc7d2102e1ee6650aac74d92dcb906e17b7d577792cabe60cc6e0e05847",
      "text": "嗯！花音他们要一直\n一直做好朋友哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_24</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac17296249419c11e16638bb4157f276ef6f063e7189b7b34953b4c335e5ac13",
      "text": "结业典礼当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c142e21bdf43d6bb94645dc3b5b2335bc090ae7692101391f47ee7ee06e42c88",
      "text": "幼儿园·体育馆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90cea714e1adf0aba6bd198e5c51a3703717d4f72eb5c5d5eaec8171ee05151",
      "text": "结业典礼到此结束。……接下来，\n我们邀请到了惊喜嘉宾！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:702cd6636e48e90cb7bfe9a6c7ac26f288b43c8d5c99c5182b08190dde9f2879",
      "text": "各位嘉宾，请进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf4d398c9cf7f7f0eae83c612bd8121c60d692c45cceddb2cf8916e36569ce4",
      "text": "好——♪大家，下午好～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66f11dbf2310fb17f1259596757b205e0b350a9d43c8d18e3bb1869922b25105",
      "text": "哇，是花音君～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2c72f6d6ca6a8a8c87d9cd1c30f2a61b5db8860cc89f1acaa3fe6555d1a911",
      "text": "直央君和志狼君也在耶！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26057846ddf09ea1c7ffdce4c6bf5e3e587408917ef1fbecf1135998e2f9798c",
      "text": "大家下午好！\n知道我们的名字吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3d030c0709da7669456a722559bf12cd392756d48d8a5f0b9f4a6960a4255b1",
      "text": "知道的小朋友，\n大声喊出花音他们的名字吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83c613038571ba538a6b529c2bde509b66962112649355c59b3cb6520cc2dd94",
      "text": "我们的名字是——？预备！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82cfb419250bb082a51786a394f59af03bd16fd123aab831ead7d049d7697304",
      "text": "もふもふえん！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb76cc13a1a8ed49d960c4335fb2dc085c85f516582535f58e5f464ace772a76",
      "text": "谢谢大家叫我们的名字！\n那么，惊喜舞台现在开始咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e660ae4aebeed15b91bb7f25f75c9108e4d33c1590edd2287d32075eefd8238",
      "text": "第一首歌是我们的新歌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_j:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f730585e06d4b58fc9a73934a98d0b089c416ec1d4b46a6e5077166d6f0919df",
      "text": "春风接力棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05577d4b42c71f5e3b678ab89393b1ae8ed557ca8fdd23a11a873956200fd80d",
      "text": "（小朋友、家长还有老师们，脸上都洋溢着最棒的笑容！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d56b8536d8bbbfb6be41ab7f8f7f6d038e0e85294fbc512216aba1dfd9d5aa4b",
      "text": "谢谢大家的聆听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a75e4507a74f9e0b9ac5f9025f4714015b29f0c35ba5c10065bcba84656d4c1",
      "text": "谢谢大家的加油啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3256834a2b75a2b7fdfd86699d2e369bc324150ba18caa043283258b952a6feb",
      "text": "各位，今天谢谢大家！\n还有，祝大家结业快乐～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fda4784561e40893fd4ffcd0910976da050f32831960aefcd0ab28023e8a4b82",
      "text": "……我长大了以后，\n想成为像花音君那样可爱的小偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42418de9abe5464fb61de5b5ca15338a7e8c3c64c4f748a8a25d3ec2e8cafee0",
      "text": "我想成为像直央君那样的\n大哥哥……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35279f9eae81377f7768ee0c57e3f0a5c2b45bb9f02c3defc0fdf128e8fb2b6d",
      "text": "我想和志狼君一样，\n跳超帅气的大段舞！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ee7d50091faaa80b7dd63f2d69cd4141bc6fd0ff1d25a067b8ddeeeef6b9ce6",
      "text": "嘿嘿，对吧对吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca26708c85cab4c33abf235e578451c19c55c8a607676305f8b244848666e690",
      "text": "嗯！……不过，もふもふえん的\n大哥哥们，长大了以后想成为什么呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd10f7da0a70e4b2cbdf56e0e66f09e1c6be24b9d172cd3d02052332f4bcfc68",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，那个呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43995e52d99c5553b560a5a9e4a335d50cb151bb4db8ff6c3b4517e36bb64428",
      "text": "……要比现在，超级帅气！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da86a603a11e589b5b094d51f09560a9161489bbce3ae5616b2cb1111e745b4b",
      "text": "而且非常可靠。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_k:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a96b35f97e34bc520f0b69b3882e3dbd133577abde949ebaaf4727126eb74602",
      "text": "又可爱又闪耀的，属于大家的偶像哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
